# The Night Lord's fourth job node, and the branch's burst: explosive charms
# that ride out on the shurikens the character is already throwing.
#
# GMS's own figures: 475+19x% five times on six enemies for one charm, one
# charm prepared every ten seconds for nothing, and 46 of them dropped in at
# once by the active half -- two to four spent on every attack skill pressed,
# for 1000 MP on a 120s cooldown.
#
# ONE bank, filled two ways, which is how GMS states it: a charm is a charm,
# and the passive and active halves differ only in what puts one in hand. That
# is also the whole of GMS's "the active and passive effects cannot trigger
# simultaneously" -- the clock that prepares one is held while a load stands,
# and starts again the moment the burst's charges are gone.
#
# Which makes the 60s a ceiling that never binds. Namu times the 46 out in 14
# to 17 Quad Star presses about 94% of the time, which at that skill's 600ms
# is 8 to 11 seconds; the duration is there for a player who stops attacking.
#
# Three charms a press, GMS's two-to-four averaged. Spread over 46 that is 16
# presses, inside the band namu measures.
#
# The charms are the character's own swing rather than something on a clock,
# so Shadow Partner copies them and the Mark goes off on them. Namu states
# both in so many words: the real hit count is twice what is printed and the
# damage 1.7x, and 408,595% for a whole bank is the 240,350% below with the
# shadow already in it.
#
# Dropped: the 1000 MP, the throwing stars a charm consumes, and the immunity
# to attack reflection, none of which this game has.
name: "Throw Blasting"
description:
  "Throw shurikens with explosive charms attached. The charms explode after "
  "the shurikens hit, dealing additional attack to nearby enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_NIGHT_LORD_V skill_order: 4 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_CLAW
base_delay_ms: 960
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 60.0
  magazine {
    label: "Explosive Charm"
    charges: 46
    charges_per_swing: 3
    spent_by_every_swing: true
    recharge_seconds: 10.0
    recharge_max: 1
    max_enemies: 6
    lines: 5
    base { skill_pct: 4.94 }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.19 }
  }
}
